{"h":3395,"w":2400,"lines":[{"h":0.015797320748948129,"x":0.84111681764560575,"y":0.063045147341051155,"c":1,"w":0.082990303039550795,"t":"Reading"},{"x":0.086419752197926844,"h":0.014723203769140158,"y":0.1089517080434651,"t":"READING PASSAGE 2","c":1,"w":0.31069959004720049},{"y":0.14486930651215113,"w":0.82730087280273445,"h":0.020062013003795287,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 14-26, which are based on Reading","x":0.086342040756248087,"c":1},{"h":0.017626691622784629,"c":1,"x":0.084088786723139269,"t":"Passage 2.","w":0.11173323313395184,"y":0.1629796740988011},{"c":1,"x":0.080246913614726759,"y":0.66279069744785313,"t":"D","w":0.016460905075073237,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"h":0.026702950503435852,"t":"The Intersection of Health Sciences and Geography","w":0.71446416219075526,"y":0.19782553642582634,"c":1,"x":0.14588008174383976},{"t":"While many diseases that affect humans have been eradicated due to","x":0.12962963046065548,"y":0.24116607774887666,"w":0.66049382527669276,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"w":0.78837437947591138,"h":0.023115917425975629,"y":0.25570064963783912,"x":0.12742001075811468,"c":1,"t":"improvements in vaccinations and the availability of healthcare, there are still areas"},{"x":0.12953747161701681,"t":"around the world where certain health issues are more prevalent. In a world that is","y":0.27459636875590798,"w":0.7779785664876302,"h":0.020087378044712501,"c":1},{"x":0.12748879517762912,"c":1,"w":0.7614654032389323,"y":0.2932284163736556,"t":"far more globalised than ever before, people come into contact with one another","h":0.020312667595062339},{"y":0.31242638383520638,"w":0.77777776082356775,"c":1,"x":0.12757202482811503,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"through travel and living closer and closer to each other. As a result, super-viruses"},{"c":1,"t":"and other infections resistant to antibiotics are becoming more and more common.","w":0.78218495686848966,"x":0.12949962051814926,"h":0.021738591547989627,"y":0.32709269214166847},{"y":0.35747938768196086,"h":0.016195524146054074,"t":"Geography can often play a very large role in the health concerns of certain","x":0.12962963924883988,"w":0.71399175008138027,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.78826044718424471,"y":0.37351926301703509,"h":0.02149818249669877,"x":0.12748935311995241,"t":"populations. For instance, depending on where you live, you will not have the same"},{"h":0.015998644317698818,"w":0.77777776082356787,"c":1,"t":"health concerns as someone who lives in a different geographical region. Perhaps","x":0.12757202482555943,"y":0.39389534869120857},{"x":0.1275720194967071,"y":0.41133720914280114,"c":1,"h":0.017441860778592888,"w":0.75720163981119804,"t":"one of the most obvious examples of this idea is malaria-prone areas, which are"},{"x":0.12757202225571027,"y":0.42873969376621557,"h":0.016027748233718886,"c":1,"w":0.73868311564127598,"t":"usually tropical regions that foster a warm and damp environment in which the"},{"c":1,"t":"mosquitos that can give people this disease can grow. Malaria is much less of a","x":0.12757202860996814,"y":0.44758539481452386,"h":0.016195524146054074,"w":0.75308639526367194},{"t":"problem in high-altitude deserts, for instance.","y":0.46511627890780693,"h":0.017510340547954861,"x":0.12757202671215423,"c":1,"w":0.43209874471028648},{"y":0.49263839808669574,"t":"in some countries, geographical factors influence the health and well-being of","x":0.12551440098413982,"w":0.7366255187988282,"h":0.017667844522968212,"c":1},{"w":0.74691360473632817,"y":0.51017441844493649,"h":0.017505204860116641,"t":"the population in very obvious ways. In many large cities, the wind is not strong","c":1,"x":0.12757200408873851},{"h":0.019233074570151554,"t":"enough to clear the air of the massive amounts of smog and pollution that cause","x":0.12749171713092627,"y":0.52657723881400431,"c":1,"w":0.75942164103190102},{"h":0.017441860778592888,"t":"asthma, lung problems, eyesight issues and more in the people who live there. Part","w":0.79218109130859382,"c":1,"x":0.12551439250310106,"y":0.54651162774757145},{"w":0.7633744812011718,"y":0.56389870417198884,"c":1,"x":0.12757201852162561,"t":"of the problem is, of course, the massive number of cars being driven, in addition","h":0.017496644818740692},{"t":"to factories that run on coal power. The rapid industrialisation of some countries in","y":0.58127208488129445,"w":0.77572016398111976,"h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1,"x":0.12551440347377252},{"x":0.12543322437341894,"h":0.019965375129690655,"c":1,"t":"recent years has also led to the cutting down of forests to allow for the expansion of","w":0.79236434936523426,"y":0.59760795594174065},{"w":0.77366256713867188,"x":0.12551439509626391,"t":"big cities, which makes it even harder to fight the pollution with the fresh air that is","y":0.61627906960262857,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.19135801951090495,"t":"produced by plants.","h":0.016003780005537038,"x":0.1255144057918112,"y":0.63515901082388271},{"w":0.77798110961914069,"x":0.12130785050487893,"y":0.66006204083731734,"c":1,"t":"It is in situations like these that the field of health geography comes into its own. It","h":0.020283787775657536},{"y":0.67933645591346248,"t":"is an increasingly important area of study in a world where diseases like polio are","x":0.12338149229960597,"w":0.76969385782877597,"h":0.018556488135959004,"c":1},{"t":"re-emerging, respiratory diseases continue to spread, and malaria-prone areas","w":0.75308639526367194,"c":1,"x":0.12345680199621095,"y":0.6975853947927263,"h":0.017667844522968212},{"h":0.019140164899882239,"x":0.12551440727307853,"t":"are still fighting to find a better cure. Health geography is the combination of, on","y":0.7164310952728471,"w":0.75102879842122405,"c":1},{"y":0.73401162774201123,"w":0.77160491943359377,"h":0.017460692757290897,"x":0.12345679917849793,"c":1,"t":"the one hand, knowledge regarding geography and methods used to analyse and"},{"h":0.021004525174521671,"c":1,"y":0.75038020928428373,"w":0.77180124918619786,"t":"interpret geographical information, and on the other, the study of health, diseases","x":0.12334294584751547},{"x":0.12345677871652243,"h":0.016019188192342826,"c":1,"t":"and healthcare practices around the world. The aim of this hybrid science is to","y":0.77031802125123716,"w":0.74074076334635419},{"t":"create solutions for common geography-based health problems. While people will","w":0.77366256713867188,"h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.12345678215213733,"y":0.78769140137162519,"c":1},{"x":0.12345678602832094,"w":0.74897120157877595,"t":"always be prone to illness, the study of how geography affects our health could","c":1,"y":0.80523255797321314,"h":0.017500068610632802},{"x":0.12139918375201679,"t":"lead to the eradication of certain illnesses, and the prevention of others in the","w":0.73251027425130211,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.82412790683066683},{"y":0.84049927107134614,"w":0.74704096476236981,"c":1,"x":0.12338547726032555,"h":0.018613825978884613,"t":"future. By understanding why and how we get sick, we can change the way we"},{"y":0.85895170803112852,"x":0.12139916517367301,"t":"treat illness and disease specific to certain geographical locations.","w":0.63168726603190106,"h":0.016048292108362783,"c":1},{"t":"63","w":0.026748971939086985,"c":1,"x":0.8888888884131726,"y":0.93604651143122397,"h":0.01453488398216074},{"w":0.20824633280436194,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96768258536995222,"h":0.016454192297478354,"x":0.39483721299237268,"c":1}]}